---
import { siteConfig } from '../config/site';

const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="bg-keraton-950 text-keraton-100 border-t-4 border-jogja-500 mt-20">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 lg:py-16">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8 lg:gap-12">
      
      <!-- Brand & Mission Statement -->
      <div class="md:col-span-1 space-y-4">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-keraton-800 flex items-center justify-center text-white border border-jogja-400 shadow-plang-sm">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-jogja-300" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.2" d="M8 7h12m0 0l-4-4m4 4l-4 4m0 6H4m0 0l4 4m-4-4l4-4" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="text-xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white">
            Panduan<span class="text-keraton-300">Rute</span><span class="text-jogja-400">Jogja</span>
          </span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-keraton-200/90 leading-relaxed">
          Inisiatif panduan independen utilitas publik untuk memudahkan mobilitas warga lokal, pelajar, dan wisatawan menggunakan transportasi umum di Daerah Istimewa Yogyakarta.
        </p>
        <div class="pt-2 text-xs text-keraton-300/80">
          <span class="block font-bold text-jogja-300">Alamat Korespondensi &amp; Email:</span>
          <p class="text-keraton-200 text-[11px] mt-0.5">Jl. Malioboro No. 42, Sosromenduran, Gedong Tengen, Kota Yogyakarta 55271</p>
          <a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.contactEmail}`} class="text-jogja-400 hover:text-white underline font-semibold mt-1 inline-block">
            {siteConfig.contactEmail}
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Kategori Navigasi -->
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-xs font-bold tracking-wider text-jogja-300 uppercase mb-4 border-b border-keraton-800 pb-2">
          Kategori Transportasi
        </h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-xs">
          {siteConfig.categories.map((cat) => (
            <li>
              <a href={`/kategori/${cat.slug}`} class="text-keraton-200 hover:text-white transition-colors flex items-center gap-1.5 font-medium">
                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-jogja-400"></span>
                {cat.name}
              </a>
            </li>
          ))}
          <li>
            <a href="/kategori/trans-jogja" class="text-keraton-200 hover:text-white transition-colors">
              Rute Bus Trans Jogja (1A - 5B)
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/kategori/kereta-bandara" class="text-keraton-200 hover:text-white transition-colors">
              KRL Jogja - Solo &amp; KA Bandara YIA
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/kategori/tiket-wisata" class="text-keraton-200 hover:text-white transition-colors">
              Tarif &amp; Integrasi Antarmoda Wisata
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Panduan Populer -->
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-xs font-bold tracking-wider text-jogja-300 uppercase mb-4 border-b border-keraton-800 pb-2">
          Rute Prioritas Wisatawan
        </h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-xs">
          <li>
            <a href="/panduan/rute-halte-trans-jogja-koridor-1a-prambanan-malioboro" class="text-keraton-200 hover:text-white transition-colors">
              Trans Jogja 1A (Prambanan - Malioboro)
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/panduan/cara-naik-ka-bandara-yia-stasiun-tugu-kulon-progo" class="text-keraton-200 hover:text-white transition-colors">
              KA Bandara YIA dari Stasiun Tugu
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/panduan/jadwal-tarif-krl-commuter-line-jogja-solo-terbaru" class="text-keraton-200 hover:text-white transition-colors">
              Jadwal &amp; Tarif KRL Jogja - Solo
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/panduan/cara-pembayaran-trans-jogja-emoney-qris-tunai" class="text-keraton-200 hover:text-white transition-colors">
              Cara Bayar Trans Jogja (QRIS &amp; Kartu)
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/panduan/panduan-rute-angkutan-umum-jogja-candi-borobudur" class="text-keraton-200 hover:text-white transition-colors">
              Transportasi Umum Jogja ke Borobudur
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Legalitas & Compliance -->
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-xs font-bold tracking-wider text-jogja-300 uppercase mb-4 border-b border-keraton-800 pb-2">
          Kebijakan &amp; Redaksi
        </h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-xs">
          {siteConfig.legalNavItems.map((legal) => (
            <li>
              <a href={legal.href} class="text-keraton-200 hover:text-white transition-colors font-medium">
                {legal.title}
              </a>
            </li>
          ))}
          <li>
            <a href="/redaksi" class="text-keraton-200 hover:text-white transition-colors font-medium">
              Dewan Redaksi &amp; Verifikasi Lapangan
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/privacy" class="text-keraton-200 hover:text-white transition-colors">
              Kebijakan Cookie &amp; Iklan
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Official Transit Disclaimer -->
    <div class="mt-12 pt-6 border-t border-keraton-800/80 text-[11px] text-keraton-300/70 leading-relaxed">
      <div class="p-4 rounded-lg bg-keraton-900 border border-keraton-800 flex items-start gap-3">
        <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-jogja-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
        </svg>
        <p>
          <strong>Pemberitahuan Status Independen:</strong> PanduanRuteJogja.com adalah situs panduan informasi publik independen dan bukan merupakan situs resmi dari Dinas Perhubungan DIY, PT KAI, KAI Commuter, maupun pengelola Trans Jogja. Seluruh merek dagang dan nama layanan merupakan hak milik operator masing-masing. Informasi dihimpun dari regulasi tarif resmi dan observasi rute langsung di lapangan.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Copyright -->
    <div class="mt-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between text-xs text-keraton-400 gap-4">
      <p>© {currentYear} {siteConfig.name}. Seluruh hak cipta dilindungi undang-undang.</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-[11px]">
        <a href="/privacy" class="hover:text-white">Privasi</a>
        <span>•</span>
        <a href="/terms" class="hover:text-white">Syarat &amp; Ketentuan</a>
        <span>•</span>
        <a href="/sitemap.xml" class="hover:text-white">Sitemap XML</a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</footer>
